{"item":{"key":"moment:3187907","id":"3187907","kind":"moment","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"c782182a37eb4562669ac9f0"},"time":1674230400000,"text":"早安～ 给这样的歌做后期混音就有种开心的感觉，很喜庆很热闹，关键是很有批改作业的成就感～[emot=acfun,1903/] 修音只是小修，应该是没有拉出电音的，表示大家伙干声质量已经很不错了。樱桃奶老师的音准（意外的）很不错，小刘声音很有活力，咩咩灯哥全方面优等生，超图猫rap各有风格。都很棒。 多人合唱的混音主要是对轨和eq/音量调节，大家的交音格式从mp4到acc也是千奇百怪，这个点还蛮有意思的。[emot=acfun,1853/]好在音质没有差很多……要是大家听着觉得还不错我就很开心啦！ 丸师傅的视频也超有创意的，喜欢！ 图图统筹也算是努力过了。 最后的祝福语好像丸师傅有加几句我没听到过的内容？好像听到言宝傻哥了。[emot=acfun,1879/]hxd联动hjm～ 总之，祝每一位图年快乐～[emot=acfun,1910/]","title":"","images":[],"cover":"","duration":"","views":0,"counts":{"commentCount":47,"likeCount":180,"bananaCount":187,"shareCount":0},"url":"https://m.acfun.cn/communityCircle/moment/3187907","timePrecision":"day","source":{"key":"video:40489993","id":"40489993","kind":"video","user":{"id":"416752","name":"tsukasalol","avatar":"70748992f13c5fd3dcac10d9"},"time":1674214248202,"text":"","title":"【HJM】新年快乐~","images":[],"cover":"45efb5038f9803a07710c7a8","duration":"03:45","views":81927,"counts":{"commentCount":437,"likeCount":2599,"bananaCount":13716,"shareCount":195},"url":"https://www.acfun.cn/v/ac40489993"},"commentsPending":false,"archivedComments":46,"archivedRoots":43,"threads":{"786056752":{"pages":["comments/3187907/threads/786056752/1.json"],"savedReplies":1,"reportedReplies":1,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"786056752","root":"786056752","user":{"id":"332036","name":"怎么还不下班","avatar":"7e4f8332c74d1ee0b80a1ef8"},"text":"（很有活力）","time":1674266477829,"floor":26,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":1,"hot":false}},"786056141":{"pages":["comments/3187907/threads/786056141/1.json"],"savedReplies":2,"reportedReplies":2,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"786056141","root":"786056141","user":{"id":"212476","name":"CAY全家桶","avatar":"36e96461c5690041cf23e210"},"text":"除夕快乐！所以对搞子的评点呢？","time":1674265357145,"floor":2,"likes":3,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyTo